@startuml 12_communication_reconcile
' Communication (collaboration) diagram: run_reconciliation_tick() for one runtime
' whose inspect succeeds. Same content as a sequence diagram, but numbered and compact.
skinparam shadowing false
hide circle
hide empty members
left to right direction

object "loop : Reconciliation loop" as Loop
object "state : AppState" as App
object "adapter : RuntimeAdapter" as Adapter
object "reconciler : Reconciler" as Rec
object "log : DecisionLog" as Log

Loop --> App : 1: run_reconciliation_tick()
App --> Adapter : 2: inspect()
App --> Rec : 3: get(runtime_id)\n6: update(runtime_id, snapshot)
App --> Log : 4: record_resident_transition(...)\n5: record_runtime_snapshot_event(...)

note bottom of Rec
  If inspect() fails, step 2 is followed by
  record_error(runtime_id, error) instead. The last
  good snapshot is kept and marked stale.
end note
@enduml
